description = "Provisional entry (Claude, 2026-10-08): Stage II of the River Listener line, the trunk lengthened, the gill fans widened into backward-swept plates, a second brow ridge forming a resonance chamber; it can send a call round a bend but cannot tell a living reply from an echo. Working name pending Preston's approval. Arena sprite standing in for a front; no back view, default stats, no turn-based moves (Grok). Arena kit adds Still Water and the Listening passive."
